{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華指控以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聽耶和華的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂指控住在這片土地上的居民，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「這片土地上的人不忠不信，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫無良善，不認識上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們賭咒、撒謊、兇殺、偷竊、通姦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為所欲為，血案纍纍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，這片土地要哀鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有的居民都要消亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田間的野獸、空中的飛鳥、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水裡的魚類也要滅絕。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「誰都不要指控別人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰都不要責備別人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我要指控你們這些祭司。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們白天黑夜都要跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知也要跟你們一起跌倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要毀滅你們的母親。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民因無知而遭滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們拒絕認識我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要拒絕讓你們做我的祭司；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們忘記你們上帝的律法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要忘記你們的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們祭司越增多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所犯的罪也越多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要使你們的尊榮變為羞恥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們祭司食用我子民的贖罪祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滿心希望他們犯罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將來，我的子民如何，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們祭司也如何。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要照你們的所作所為懲罰你們、報應你們，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們吃卻不得飽足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行淫卻不得後代","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們背棄耶和華，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沉溺酒色，喪失心智。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「我的子民祈求木頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隨從木杖的指引。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淫亂的心使他們走入歧途，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不忠不貞，背棄他們的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在山頂和高崗上的橡樹、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"楊樹和栗樹下獻祭燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為樹蔭怡人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「所以，你們的女兒淫亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的兒媳通姦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我不會因此而懲罰她們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們也與娼妓苟合，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與廟妓一起獻祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無知的民族必走向滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「雖然以色列如同妓女，對我不忠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不要使猶大犯罪。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要到吉甲去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要到伯·亞文","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":"去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要憑永活的耶和華起誓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列桀驁不馴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同桀驁不馴的母牛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華怎能牧養他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同在草場上牧養羊羔呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"與偶像為伍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任由他吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們酒足興盡之後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便不住地行淫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的首領戀慕羞恥之事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"風要把他們捲走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必因所獻的祭而蒙羞。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"「行淫卻不得後代」此處的意思是指責以色列人祭拜迦南人掌管生育的神明。他們以為這樣能帶來更多後代。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":10}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"「伯·亞文」意思是「罪惡之家」，在此指伯特利。「伯特利」意思是「上帝之家」，但當時已變成祭拜偶像之地。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":15}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"「以法蓮」為北國以色列最大的支派，聖經中有時用來代指北國以色列。本卷書中下同。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}